      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَافِرٌ</span></b>  One <i>who</i> [<i>carries</i> or] <i>helps to carry loads,</i>
or <i>burdens:</i> (TA:) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَوَافِرُ</span> [pl. of ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَافِرَةٌ</span></b> ] female
slaves <i>that carry water-skins</i> (S) or [<i>other</i>] <i>loads,</i>
or <i>burdens.</i> (TA.) ― 
